<title>USA: EuroMed Inc Q3 shr falls.</title>
<headline>EuroMed Inc Q3 shr falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					   September 30   September 30</p>
<p>					  1996     1995    1996    1995</p>
<p> Sales				$16,124 $ 7,745 $34,000 $22,919</p>
<p> Net income			     120     208     483     624</p>
<p> Earnings per share		  0.03    0.10    0.16    0.31</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said its net income in the third quarter of 1996 was hurt by additional acquisition-related costs, the Dutch Government Pricing Law with special inventory effects on the quarter, and an increase in taxes.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
